---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${profile.name}: ${profile.roleLine}.`}>
  <article class="stack-lg">
    <header class="stack">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>{profile.name}</h1>
      <p class="role" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent)">{profile.title}</p>
    </header>
    <div class="stack prose">
      <p>
        I'm a Principal Cloud & Platform Architect and Enterprise Architect with 16+ years of enterprise delivery across Saudi
        government platforms, telecom, fintech and IoT. I design cloud-native microservices, event-driven streaming platforms and
        multi-region disaster recovery that hold up under regulation (PCI DSS 4.0) and real load.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an enterprise architect I work with TOGAF ADM, C4 modelling and Domain-Driven Design to turn strategy into governed
        architecture: capability maps, decision records, target states and migration roadmaps. As a platform architect I build it:
        Kubernetes, Kafka and Debezium CDC, zero-trust networking, GitOps and applied AI. I treat licences, security boundaries and
        evidence as first-class design inputs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today I'm Principal Cloud & AI Platform Architect at Spectro Systems (remote). I'm also building <a href="/work/twinfra">Twinfra</a>,
        an MIT-licensed, AWS-compatible private cloud.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">{profile.location}.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
